WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.399
This query creates pairs of customers that share the
same normalized phone number The

00:00:06.426 --> 00:00:10.663
condition a ID less than b ID avoids comparing a row
with itself and avoids

00:00:10.676 --> 00:00:16.850
duplicate pair orderings These are possible
duplicates not proven duplicates

00:00:18.575 --> 00:00:26.108
A shared phone number may represent one person a
household or reused contact information Review

00:00:26.121 --> 00:00:27.293
may be necessary
